          "channel": "other",
          "instructions": "Lost/stolen credit card: 24X7 helpline — dial 39 02 02 02 (prefix local STD code) or 1860 180 1290; in the IVR press 2 to report a lost/stolen card. 1860 500 1290 is also listed; 1800 180 1290 is the toll-free line. Online: log in at sbicard.com and click \"Block Lost \\Stolen Card\" (FAQ: \"Requests\" tab > \"Report Lost/Stolen Card\"). SBI Card mobile app: Menu > Service Request > \"Report Lost/Stolen\". A blocked card cannot be reactivated — a replacement with a new number is issued to the registered address. Customer-care desk hours 8 AM-8 PM Mon-Sat; e-mail customercare@sbicard.com. No overseas number is published for personal cards; corporate cardholders abroad are directed to Visa's 24X7 toll-free emergency helpline.",
